{"content":[{"c":["BEAST"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Animal in both the OT and NT, having in some cases a figurative significance. The word has a variety of meanings in the OT. Some of the diversity is due to inconsistent translations of several Hebrew words that can signify “living creature” as well as “beast,” but which have sometimes been translated only as “beast.” In the OT, therefore, beast can refer to the following:"],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":["1. In general, any animal (e.g., ",{"href":"?bref=Gen.1.24","r":"Gen.1.24","rawR":"Gen.1.24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.1.24","value":"Gen.1.24"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 1:24"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.36.6","r":"Ps.36.6","rawR":"Ps.36.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.36.6","value":"Ps.36.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ps 36:6"},"), but often distinguished from fish, birds, and insects (e.g., ",{"href":"?bref=Gen.6.7","r":"Gen.6.7","rawR":"Gen.6.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.6.7","value":"Gen.6.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 6:7"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Lev.11.2","r":"Lev.11.2","rawR":"Lev.11.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Lev.11.2","value":"Lev.11.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lv 11:2"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Deut.4.17","r":"Deut.4.17","rawR":"Deut.4.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Deut.4.17","value":"Deut.4.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"Dt 4:17"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Job.12.7","r":"Job.12.7","rawR":"Job.12.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Job.12.7","value":"Job.12.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jb 12:7"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Job.35.11","r":"Job.35.11","rawR":"Job.35.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Job.35.11","value":"Job.35.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"35:11"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Zeph.1.3","r":"Zeph.1.3","rawR":"Zeph.1.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Zeph.1.3","value":"Zeph.1.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"Zep 1:3"},")."],"sourceClass":"list-space","t":"p"},{"c":["2. A domesticated animal (e.g., ",{"href":"?bref=Exod.19.13","r":"Exod.19.13","rawR":"Exod.19.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.19.13","value":"Exod.19.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 19:13"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Exod.22.10","r":"Exod.22.10","rawR":"Exod.22.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.22.10","value":"Exod.22.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"22:10"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Num.3.13","r":"Num.3.13","rawR":"Num.3.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.3.13","value":"Num.3.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 3:13"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Num.31.47","r":"Num.31.47","rawR":"Num.31.47","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.31.47","value":"Num.31.47"}],"t":"ref","v":"31:47"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Judg.20.48","r":"Judg.20.48","rawR":"Judg.20.48","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.20.48","value":"Judg.20.48"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 20:48"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Pr.12.10","r":"Pr.12.10","rawR":"Pr.12.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Pr.12.10","value":"Pr.12.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"Prv 12:10"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Jer.21.6","r":"Jer.21.6","rawR":"Jer.21.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.21.6","value":"Jer.21.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 21:6"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Zech.8.10","r":"Zech.8.10","rawR":"Zech.8.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Zech.8.10","value":"Zech.8.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"Zec 8:10"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. A wild and sometimes carnivorous animal (e.g., ",{"href":"?bref=Gen.37.20","r":"Gen.37.20","rawR":"Gen.37.20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.37.20","value":"Gen.37.20"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 37:20"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Exod.23.11","r":"Exod.23.11","rawR":"Exod.23.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Exod.23.11","value":"Exod.23.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ex 23:11"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Deut.28.26","r":"Deut.28.26","rawR":"Deut.28.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Deut.28.26","value":"Deut.28.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"Dt 28:26"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Sam.17.44","r":"1Sam.17.44","rawR":"1Sam.17.44","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Sam.17.44","value":"1Sam.17.44"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Sm 17:44"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ezek.14.15","r":"Ezek.14.15","rawR":"Ezek.14.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezek.14.15","value":"Ezek.14.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ez 14:15"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. The figurative usage of the word “beast” is most apparent in the books of Daniel and Revelation. In Daniel (especially ",{"href":"?bref=Dan.7.1-28","r":"Dan.7.1-28","rawR":"Dan.7.1-28","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Dan.7.1-28","value":"Dan.7.1-28"}],"t":"ref","v":"Dn 7"},") the beast is a symbol of a world ruler who persecutes and oppresses the people of God. In Revelation the apostle John took over that concept with its vivid imagery to speak of the final persecution of God’s people at the end of history. John’s beast in its apostasy closely resembles the “antichrist” of his earlier epistles (",{"href":"?bref=1Jn.2.18,22","r":"1Jn.2.18,22","rawR":"1Jn.2.18,22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Jn.2.18,22","value":"1Jn.2.18,22"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Jn 2:18, 22"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Jn.4.3","r":"1Jn.4.3","rawR":"1Jn.4.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Jn.4.3","value":"1Jn.4.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"4:3"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=2Jn.1.7","r":"2Jn.1.7","rawR":"2Jn.1.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Jn.1.7","value":"2Jn.1.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Jn 1:7"},") and Paul’s “man of lawlessness” (",{"href":"?bref=2Thes.2.3","r":"2Thes.2.3","rawR":"2Thes.2.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Thes.2.3","value":"2Thes.2.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Thes 2:3"},"). Many Bible commentators regard the three as designating the same individual. ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Antichrist_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Antichrist_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Antichrist_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Antichrist"},"; ",{"href":"?item=Armageddon_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Armageddon_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Armageddon_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Armageddon"},"; ",{"href":"?item=MarkofGodMarkoftheBeast_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"MarkofGodMarkoftheBeast_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"MarkofGodMarkoftheBeast_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Mark of the Beast"},"; ",{"href":"?item=RevelationBookof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"RevelationBookof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"RevelationBookof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Revelation, Book of"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Beast","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Gn 1:24","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.1.24","rawQueryValue":"Gen.1.24","sourceRefExact":"Gen.1.24"},{"anchorText":"Ps 36:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ps.36.6","rawQueryValue":"Ps.36.6","sourceRefExact":"Ps.36.6"},{"anchorText":"Gn 6:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.6.7","rawQueryValue":"Gen.6.7","sourceRefExact":"Gen.6.7"},{"anchorText":"Lv 11:2","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Lev.11.2","rawQueryValue":"Lev.11.2","sourceRefExact":"Lev.11.2"},{"anchorText":"Dt 4:17","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Deut.4.17","rawQueryValue":"Deut.4.17","sourceRefExact":"Deut.4.17"},{"anchorText":"Jb 12:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Job.12.7","rawQueryValue":"Job.12.7","sourceRefExact":"Job.12.7"},{"anchorText":"35:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Job.35.11","rawQueryValue":"Job.35.11","sourceRefExact":"Job.35.11"},{"anchorText":"Zep 1:3","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Zeph.1.3","rawQueryValue":"Zeph.1.3","sourceRefExact":"Zeph.1.3"},{"anchorText":"Ex 19:13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.19.13","rawQueryValue":"Exod.19.13","sourceRefExact":"Exod.19.13"},{"anchorText":"22:10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Exod.22.10","rawQueryValue":"Exod.22.10","sourceRefExact":"Exo